        "id": 67297,
        "name": "Matchstickman",
        "username": "Matchstickman",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/matchstickman/{size}/1880_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-07-05T03:06:57.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>The H=3 in a two player game is so the game is not too easy if you are playing with less than the recommended number of heroes, making H=6 in a six player game is not making things too easy, it's the other end of the spectrum.</p><p>Though Iron Legacy really doesn't need extra help, I would play with H=6, it just wouldn't feel right to me otherwise.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>As a side note, an (H) emoticon for these forums would be awesome, or would that be difficult to implement?</p>",
        "post_number": 3,
        "post_type": 1,
