        "id": 67299,
        "name": "Rabit",
        "username": "Rabit",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/rabit/{size}/7330_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-07-05T17:24:19.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>The folks I usually play with don't play 6-hero games. Thematically, I get the interest in Freedom Six vs. Iron Legacy, but we don't enjoy having that many players in one game - we'd rather play two, 3-player games, instead. I'm sure that's just us, though.  <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/sunglasses.png?v=9\" title=\":sunglasses:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":sunglasses:\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>I have to agree an (H) emoticon would be great, but personally I'd rather get a completely new set of emoticons, first, as the ones we have are about the worst I've ever seen.&nbsp; <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slightly_frowning_face.png?v=9\" title=\":slightly_frowning_face:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slightly_frowning_face:\">  I'd actually sent Joel a bunch of suggestions for improvements just after the migration, but now I can't find them (which is really annoying as I spent a couple hours compiling that list  <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/confused.png?v=9\" title=\":confused:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":confused:\"> ).</p>",
        "post_number": 5,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T02:45:15.369Z",
